// Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬ apifyInput for microworlds/leads-finder (city-level actor) Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬Ã¢â€â‚¬
// NOTE: microworlds' own industry enum is NOT yet confirmed Ã¢â‚¬â€ passing matched
